<item>
            <title>[IGNITE-4431] Default format of the ignite log doesn&apos;t contain a date.</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-4431</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;Ignite uses the default pattern layout for the log4j loggers with the &lt;tt&gt;ABSOLUTE&lt;/tt&gt; date format. &lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;May be the &lt;tt&gt;ISO8601&lt;/tt&gt; for default is more useful because &lt;tt&gt;ABSOLUTE&lt;/tt&gt; doesn&apos;t contain date.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
                <environment></environment>
        <key id="13028127">IGNITE-4431</key>
